Directly from the Monk's FAQ:

"When you attack a monster with martial arts, you receive certain bonuses to
your chance to hit the monster and the damage you do to the monster. These
bonuses also apply to kicking a monster; thus, if you are playing barehanded
and are wearing footwear, you could kick the cockatrice to death, if
necessary. Kicking also exercises your skill in martial arts."

The FAQ is here BTW: http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/monk_faq.html


